step Fine Leather Belt to 102
  zone Azeroth
  tip Fine Leather Belt is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 100, grey 115): about 35 crafts to 102, up to 40 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 6 Light Leather and 2 Coarse Thread. Forever teaches Fine Leather Belt from 55.
  craft 3763 until 102

step Leatherworking recipes at 102
  tip Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Nimble Leather Gloves (from 95, 5s).
  learn 9074

step Nimble Leather Gloves to 125
  tip Nimble Leather Gloves is orange at 102 (yellow 120, green 132, grey 145): about 24 crafts to 125, up to 25 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Elixir of Minor Agility, 6 Medium Leather and 1 Fine Thread. Each takes an Elixir of Minor Agility: an alchemist makes it from a Swiftthistle and a Silverleaf, and the Auction House has it cheap. With no elixirs, take Fine Leather Belt on to 105 and Dark Leather Cloak (from 85: 8 Medium Leather, a Gray Dye and a Fine Thread) to 125: about 28 cloaks, 224 Medium Leather in all.
  craft 9074 until 125

step Leatherworking recipes at 125
  tip Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Cured Heavy Hide (from 125, 5s) and Heavy Armor Kit (from 125, 7s 50c).
  learn 3818
  learn 3780

step Cured Heavy Hide to 140
  tip Cured Heavy Hide is orange at 125 (yellow 135, green 140, grey 145): about 17 crafts to 140, up to 19 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Heavy Hide and 3 Salt. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data.
  craft 3818 until 140

step Heavy Armor Kit to 150
  tip Heavy Armor Kit is orange at 140 (yellow 145, green 155, grey 165): about 11 crafts to 150, up to 13 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 5 Heavy Leather and 1 Fine Thread. Five Heavy Leather a craft (beasts of level 28-40); the kits sell to vendors. Leatherworking 150 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 3780 until 150
  skill Leatherworking 150

