  tip 398 Thick Leather for Leatherworking 150-225: 46 Nightscape Headbands and 12 Nightscape Pants. Skinning: beasts of level 38-50. The arrow takes the Skinning loop that gets you them soonest from where you are and walks it until your bags hold them; the window names the loop, its lap and the laps left. Or buy them at the Auction House.
